ource":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2019","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/500184/5001840319.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2018","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/500184/5001840318.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2017","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/500184/5001840317.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2016","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/500184/5001840316.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2015","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/500184/5001840315.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2014","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/500184/5001840314.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2013","url":"https://archives.nseindia.com/annual_reports/AR_1288_HCIL_2012_2013_02092013114745.zip","source":"the data provider"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2013","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/500184/5001840313.pdf","source":"bse"}],"analysis":{"summary":"Himadri Speciality Chemical Limited reported a consolidated revenue of INR 1,432 Crores and an EBITDA of INR 313 Crores for Q1 FY27. The company is executing a strategic transformation into advanced materials, focusing on new energy materials like anode and cathode active materials, alongside carbon nanotubes and super speciality carbon black. Management emphasized a disciplined, self-funded capital allocation strategy and confirmed that Birla Tyres is expected to reach EBITDA breakeven in the current financial year. The company maintains a long-term vision to scale its cathode capacity to 200,000 MTPA over the next five years. Himadri Speciality Chemical reported Q1FY27 consolidated revenue of Rs.","themes":{"guidance":[],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"Global lithium-ion battery demand is expected to grow significantly by 2035, with LFP chemistry capturing a large share of this growth.","quote":"Global lithium-ion battery demand is projected to rise from around 1.6 terawatt hours in 2025 to nearly 6.8 terawatt hours by 2035. We are positioning ourselves for this opportunity with a fully integrated complex.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=aba2c1e9-bf26-4569-afee-2e8b196215cb.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"The company is investing INR 70 Crores in a 200 MTPA carbon nanotube facility expected to be commissioned in Q4 FY27.","quote":"Backed by a planned capex of approximately INR70 Crores, our upcoming 200 MTPA CNT manufacturing facility targeted for commissioning in Q4FY27, is expected to position Himadri among a select group of few global manufacturers serving this high-growth market.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=aba2c1e9-bf26-4569-afee-2e8b196215cb.pdf"},{"claim":"A 6,000 MTPA super speciality carbon black facility is being developed with an investment of INR 170 Crores.","quote":"We are converting 6,000 MTPA of existing capacity with a capex of INR170 Crores.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=aba2c1e9-bf26-4569-afee-2e8b196215cb.pdf"},{"claim":"The company plans to commission its initial 2,000 MTPA LFP cathode capacity in Q3 FY27.","quote":"Our initial 2,000 MTPA capacity is expected to be commissioned in Q3FY27, representing the first milestone under Phase 1 of our 40,000 MTPA expansion plan, which forms part of our broader long-term vision to scale capacity to 200,000 MTPA.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=aba2c1e9-bf26-4569-afee-2e8b196215cb.pdf"},{"claim":"The company established a 200 MTPA anode material facility at Mahistikry, West Bengal.","quote":"Established a 200 MTPA anode material facility at Mahistikry, West Bengal","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=4e3e907e-5b52-459d-8ad8-156b1c852014.pdf"},{"claim":"Speciality Chemicals Anthraquinone and Carbazole Phase 1 capex of 2,600 MTPA has a commissioning timeline of Q2FY27 and Phase 2 capex of 2,700 MTPA is targeted for Q2FY28.","quote":"Speciality Chemicals: Anthraquinone + Carbazole\nPhase 1 capex of 2,600 MTPA capacity Commissioning Q2FY27\nPhase 2 capex of 2,700 MTPA capacity Q2FY28","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=4e3e907e-5b52-459d-8ad8-156b1c852014.pdf"},{"claim":"Carbon Nano Tube commissioning is scheduled for Q4FY27 with a capacity of 200 MTPA.","quote":"Carbon Nano Tube Commissioning Q4FY27","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=4e3e907e-5b52-459d-8ad8-156b1c852014.pdf"},{"claim":"Super Speciality Carbon Black commissioning is scheduled for Q4FY28 with a 6,000 MTPA capacity.","quote":"Super Speciality Carbon Black Commissioning Q4FY28","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=4e3e907e-5b52-459d-8ad8-156b1c852014.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"The company operates a coal tar distillation capacity of 600,000 MTPA.","quote":"We operate the world's largest single location fully integrated carbon complex, with 600,000 MTPA of coal tar distillation capacity.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=aba2c1e9-bf26-4569-afee-2e8b196215cb.pdf"},{"claim":"Himadri operates 8 zero discharge plants across India and China.","quote":"8 zero discharge plants across India & China","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=4e3e907e-5b52-459d-8ad8-156b1c852014.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"The company plans to spend INR 1,000 Crores on capex in the current financial year and another INR 1,000 Crores in the next year.","quote":"Out of this, we expect around INR1,000 Crores of capex happening this year and INR1,000 Crores next year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=aba2c1e9-bf26-4569-afee-2e8b196215cb.pdf"},{"claim":"Investments include Rs. 1,125 Cr for LFP, Rs. 248 Cr for Speciality Chemicals, Rs. 70 Cr for Carbon Nano Tube, and Rs. 170 Cr for Super Speciality Carbon Black.","quote":"Capex Rs. 1,125 Cr Rs. 248 Cr Rs. 70 Cr Rs. 170 Cr","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=4e3e907e-5b52-459d-8ad8-156b1c852014.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"The company experienced a negative impact on its financial results due to currency volatility.","quote":"And this is done with. If you see last quarter also, there was a loss. This quarter, again, there's a loss. From next quarter, there will not be any impact on account of FX negative impact.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=aba2c1e9-bf26-4569-afee-2e8b196215cb.pdf"}]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"The company expects to reach EBITDA breakeven for the Birla Tyres business in the current financial year.","quote":"We reach EBITDA breakeven in this financial year only.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=aba2c1e9-bf26-4569-afee-2e8b196215cb.pdf","timeframe":"FY27"},{"claim":"Commercial operations for the India Gigafactory with IBC are on track for Q4FY27.","quote":"Commercial operations for India Gigafactory on track for Q4FY27","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=4e3e907e-5b52-459d-8ad8-156b1c852014.pdf","timeframe":"Q4FY27"},{"claim":"PCR facility commissioning for Birla Tyres is targeted by FY28.","quote":"PCR facility commissioning targeted by FY28","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=4e3e907e-5b52-459d-8ad8-156b1c852014.pdf","timeframe":"FY28"}],"coverage":{"docs_analysed":3,"kinds":["concall_transcript","concall_ppt"]}},"_meta":{"model":"gemini-3.6-flash","grounded":true,"facts_kept":16,"facts_dropped_ungrounded":8,"note":"Facts are verbatim-grounded against the company's own documents; claims whose quote was not found were dropped."}}